#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: sm-rfq.php
msgid "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-rfq.php
msgid "Requests for quotation: buyers describe what they need (profile rows weighed by SM Weight Engine or free description, quantity, delivery place and date, drawings); suppliers and manufacturers answer with a price, a price per kg and a delivery time; the buyer compares the offers, contacts suppliers and accepts one. Notifications in French and Arabic. Requires SM Core, SM Weight Engine and SM Products."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: sm-rfq.php
msgid "ReuSteel"
msgstr ""

